# ADR-019 D-19.3: there is no C extension. A word whose low bits are a compressed
# encoding (two c.nop halfwords) is an illegal instruction: mcause = 2 and mtval = the
# 32-bit instruction word. FENCE.I makes the stored word visible to fetch.
@name no-rvc-compressed-word-is-illegal
@verifies propNoCompressedDecode funcDecodeRv32im funcSystemOpSequencing funcICacheInvalidate funcDCacheCleanAll funcDrainFence
@maxcycles 6000
jal x28, setvec
handler: csrrs x20, mcause, x0
csrrs x21, 0x343, x0
jal x0, mcont
setvec: csrrw x0, mtvec, x28
li x6, 0x00010001
sw x6, 256(x31)
fence.i
addi x8, x31, 256
jalr x0, x8, 0
mcont: check x20 == 2
check x21 == 0x10001
